# Agent skills. .agents/skills is the real content and is committed, so the
# skill set a build was made against is on the record and a fresh clone has
# it without a network call. .claude/skills is only symlinks into that same
# directory, regenerated by npx skills add, and Git on Windows does not store
# them faithfully, so it stays out.
.claude/skills/
